# Third-Party Notices

This file contains the license notices for third-party libraries used in **SpriteStudio Player for wgpu**.

We would like to thank the authors and contributors of these open-source projects.

> **Generated — do not edit by hand.** `scripts/generate-licenses.sh` (cargo-about) produces this
> file from `ssplayer-wgpu` built with `--features embedded,ffi,web`: the union of what the Rust
> library, the C face (`bin/libssplayer_wgpu.*`) and the npm package (`@spritestudio/ssplayer-wgpu`)
> link. Regenerate it whenever the dependency tree moves.
>
> `SpriteStudio-SDK` itself is BSD-3-Clause and covered by [`LICENSE.md`](./LICENSE.md), not listed
> here.

